WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.773
The Carters visited Grandpa.

2
00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:12.865
"I am so glad to see you!" he said.

3
00:00:12.866 --> 00:00:18.538
"We will have lots of fun!"

4
00:00:18.539 --> 00:00:22.679
Grandpa took the kids to the park.

5
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:28.305
"Let's ride the go-karts!" Grandpa said.

6
00:00:28.306 --> 00:00:34.268
"Cool!" Harry said.

7
00:00:34.269 --> 00:00:39.879
Grandpa drove his go-kart fast.

8
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:43.083
"Be careful!" Harry said.

9
00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:51.057
"Go-karts can be dangerous!"

10
00:00:51.058 --> 00:00:55.414
"Let's go roller-skating!" Grandpa said.

11
00:00:55.415 --> 00:01:03.003
"I'll race you!"

12
00:01:03.004 --> 00:01:06.746
They skated fast.

13
00:01:06.747 --> 00:01:11.282
Grandpa almost fell down.

14
00:01:11.283 --> 00:01:16.806
"Be careful!" Emmy said.

15
00:01:16.807 --> 00:01:24.732
"Maybe we should do something else now."

16
00:01:24.733 --> 00:01:28.865
"Let's go on the slide!" Grandpa said.

17
00:01:28.866 --> 00:01:34.817
"That is a very tall slide," Oliver said.

18
00:01:34.818 --> 00:01:40.524
Grandpa said, "Come on!"

19
00:01:40.525 --> 00:01:43.551
Grandpa slid down headfirst.

20
00:01:43.552 --> 00:01:51.580
"Be careful!" Oliver said.

21
00:01:51.581 --> 00:01:55.578
"You could get hurt!"

22
00:01:55.579 --> 00:01:58.913
Grandpa looked sad.

23
00:01:58.914 --> 00:02:02.676
"I didn't mean to scare you," he said.

24
00:02:02.677 --> 00:02:06.250
"I just wanted to have fun.

25
00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:10.076
I want to be the best grandpa ever."

26
00:02:10.077 --> 00:02:14.620
Emmy hugged Grandpa.

27
00:02:14.621 --> 00:02:20.688
"You are the best grandpa ever!" she said.

28
00:02:20.689 --> 00:02:24.514
"We can have fun," Harry said.

29
00:02:24.515 --> 00:02:28.489
"Lots of fun things are not dangerous.

30
00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:31.784
Let's do safe, fun things!"

31
00:02:31.785 --> 00:02:35.855
"Okay." Grandpa thought hard.

32
00:02:35.856 --> 00:02:40.358
Then he pointed up to the sky.

33
00:02:40.359 --> 00:02:45.241
"Let's go skydiving!"

34
00:02:45.242 --> 00:02:47.543
The kids gasped.

35
00:02:47.544 --> 00:02:52.113
"Skydiving is not safe!" Harry said.

36
00:02:52.114 --> 00:02:56.283
Grandpa laughed hard.

37
00:02:56.284 --> 00:02:59.631
"Just kidding!" he said.

38
00:02:59.632 --> 00:03:09.413
"Who wants to get some ice cream?"

